{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107100","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1810709001:0":{"text":"修复完成","source_cn":"修复完成","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1065474C8AC2EA14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810710001:0":{"text":"修理工作完成了。","source_cn":"修理工作完成了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED711E8712A3C54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810710002:0":{"text":"做得不错。你比黑金那些满嘴铜臭味的商人可靠，托安陛下会嘉奖你和西尔维娜。","source_cn":"做得不错。你比黑金那些满嘴铜臭味的商人可靠，托安陛下会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x232401EF890B4614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810710003:0":{"text":"准备启动转化器吧。告诉我，我该怎么为陛下献出灵魂，这是最后，也是最重要的一步。","source_cn":"准备启动转化器吧。告诉我，我该怎么为陛下献出灵魂，这是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDF11141BB20FA10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810710004:1":{"text":"灵魂……？不需要那种东西。","source_cn":"灵魂……？不需要那种东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x942C7554A8017AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810710005:0":{"text":"我知道你和西尔维娜不是真心归顺班题斯，但别试图和我耍花招，否则你就再也见不到你的姐姐了。","source_cn":"我知道你和西尔维娜不是真心归顺班题斯，但别试图和我耍花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x707677952E293838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810710006:0":{"text":"班题斯只需要绝对忠诚的亡灵。唯有我献出自己的灵魂，才能让他们永远效忠陛下。","source_cn":"班题斯只需要绝对忠诚的亡灵。唯有我献出自己的灵魂，才能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF97B1A14C1862BF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810710007:1":{"text":"……我没有耍花招。\n清洗记忆、篡改记忆、编造记忆，都不需要献祭灵魂。","source_cn":"……我没有耍花招。\\n清洗记忆、篡改记忆、编造记忆，都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF93D975B0E5DCD67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810710008:0":{"text":"那么，就是苔佩希撒谎了？","source_cn":"那么，就是苔佩希撒谎了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF54512FA3BB0B4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810710009:0":{"text":"我不知道。","source_cn":"我不知道。<key:dialog822>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B95C8BE600ACA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810710010:0":{"text":"……你未必可信，但至少比苔佩希好一点。","source_cn":"……你未必可信，但至少比苔佩希好一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9